## 1. Project Overview

Mosonic is a Thailand-based **Software-as-a-Service (SaaS)** platform that helps businesses automatically produce marketing content, social media materials, and digital media assets through AI orchestration.

### Mission

Replace manual content workflows with intelligent, automated AI orchestration — and ensure the high-value intellectual property remains within Thailand.

### Core Innovation

Mosonic does **not** train foundational AI language models. The proprietary innovation lives in the **Orchestration Layer** — how user inputs are translated into precise AI instructions controlling **tone, format, length, keywords, and validation**.

### Platform Capabilities (High Level)

- Campaign-driven AI content generation (text, images, video, translation)
- Multi-channel publishing (Facebook, Instagram, Twitter/X, LinkedIn)
- Workflow automation with approval routing
- API integration with CRM, e-commerce, and distribution channels
- Real-time analytics with auto-feedback to improve campaign rules

